flowchart LR
  IR[Verified IR operands and function signature] --> LAYOUT[Selected SysV argument result and variadic layouts]
  IR --> SELECT[Original ABI program selector]
  LAYOUT --> SELECT
  SELECT --> BYTES[Concrete target byte fragments]
  SELECT --> VALUES[Explicit GPR and SSE value transfers]
  SELECT --> FRAME[Fixed-width symbolic frame patches]
  SELECT --> RELOCS[Owned direct-call relocation records]
  BYTES --> SEAL[Verify complete selected program]
  VALUES --> SEAL
  FRAME --> SEAL
  RELOCS --> SEAL
  SEAL --> ALLOC[Allocate virtual values and verify physical frame]
  ALLOC --> REPLAY[Replay programs using verified locations]
  REPLAY --> ELF[Original object bytes and relocations]
  ELF --> READ[Independent allocated-byte and disassembler checks]
  ELF --> RUN[Native reference and mixed-toolchain behavior]
